feat(compiler): Add ReactiveModuleDecl AST node and parse .vox.ui reactive modules
scale: ~187 lines across 7 files [M]

- **`crates/vox-compiler/src/ast/decl/ui.rs`**:
    - Added `ReactiveModuleDecl` struct for `.vox.ui` reactive modules, including `name`, `members` (a `Vec<ReactiveMemberDecl>`), and `span`.
- **`crates/vox-compiler/src/ast/decl/types.rs`**:
    - Added `ReactiveModule` variant to the `Decl` enum, wrapping `ReactiveModuleDecl`.
