    - Added a `file_kind` field to the `Parser` struct, defaulting to `FileKind::Source` in `Parser::new()`.
- **`crates/vox-compiler/src/parser/descent/decl/head.rs`**:
    - Implemented `parse_reactive_module_decl()` to parse consecutive module-scope reactive members (`state`, `derived`, `effect`, `on mount`, `on cleanup`) into a `ReactiveModuleDecl`.
    - Modified `parse_decl()` to check `self.file_kind.allows_module_scope_reactive_members()` and dispatch to `parse_reactive_module_decl()` when appropriate.
- **`crates/vox-compiler/src/parser/descent/tests.rs`**:
    - Added three new parser tests:
        - One to confirm that module-scope `state` in a regular `.vox` file results in a parse error.
        - One to verify that module-scope `state` in a `.vox.ui` file parses correctly into a `ReactiveModuleDecl`.
        - One to ensure that module-scope `derived` and `effect` alongside `state` in a `.vox.ui` file parse cleanly.
- **`crates/vox-corpus/src/corpus/extract_vox/part_ast.rs`**:
    - Updated `decl_kind_and_name` to include the new `Decl::ReactiveModule` variant.
- **`crates/vox-mens/src/training/core.rs`**:
    - Updated `extract_constructs` to include the new `Decl::ReactiveModule` variant.

